    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Halnon Humphreys Estate Agents are delighted to bring to the market this remarkable 4-bedroom detached coastal property extending to c. 138 sq m/1485 sq ft and featuring spacious rooms and an excellent B3 energy rating. This superb property, which was built in 2007, comes to the market in excellent condition both internally and externally and boasts a beautiful south facing and mature rear garden.\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nThis beautiful family home is located in a popular coastal area with a wide variety of activities and amenities all within a few minutes walk. Numerous beautiful beaches, forest walks, top golf courses and internationally acclaimed spa's catering to your every requirement. This friendly coastal location provides numerous eateries, cafe's, bars and plenty to keep the kids entertained by way of ten pin bowling, amusements, crazy golf and a host of other leisurely activities. Located less than an hour from Dublin, Aylesbridge is an ideal coastal getaway surrounded by an array of amenities, perfect for family living.\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nThe property offers driveway parking for two cars to the front with additional communal parking located across from the property and a large open green area. The rear garden is fully enclosed by tidy timber and concrete fencing. There is gated access to both sides of the residence and there is a Barna sheds for storage. \r\n\r\nServices:\r\nServices include oil fired central heating, mains water & sewage and high-speed broadband is available in the area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The ground floor of this immaculate family home offers a large and welcoming entrance hallway with tiled flooring and understairs storage and off it lies the large family living room with a bay window, solid fuel stove and solid timber flooring. The kitchen and dining area are situated to the rear of the property and are wonderfully and naturally bright from morning until evening due to the south facing aspect. The dining area leads onto a newly erected decking area and well-manicured garden.  There is an adjoining utility room and a beautifully tiled WC. \r\nThe first floor of the property with it’s high ceilings, offers four spacious bedrooms. The main bedroom offers a double fitted wardrobe and an ensuite bathroom. A large family bathroom completes the first floor accommodation."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Turnkey family home extending to c. 138 sq m/1485 sq ft\r\nExcellent B3 energy rating\r\nBeautiful high ceilings throughout\r\nExcellent living space\r\nSouth facing, mature and fully enclosed rear garden\r\nLocated in a village setting minutes’ drive from Gorey Town Centre\r\nWalking distance of Riverchapel Village and Courtown Harbour \r\nJust 5.4 km to M11 motorway\r\nStunning seaside setting\r\nWalk in condition\r\nAmple parking\r\nDetached property built in 2007"
      },
      {
